{"id":"3e82291b3e069169","group":"72","path":"72/72-df-veltman-forcing.md","title":"解释性模态公式的强制关系","display":"df-veltman-forcing — 解释性模态公式的强制关系","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-df-veltman-forcing","aliases":["72-df-veltman-forcing"],"display":"df-veltman-forcing — 解释性模态公式的强制关系","depends_on":["[[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]]","[[72-df-veltman-frame]]"],"chapter":"VII","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.VII Definition13.4, print515/PDF527","source_kind":"source-based-local-formalization","verification_status":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"review_2026_10_22_deep":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-df-veltman-forcing"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-df-veltman-forcing</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-veltman-forcing — 解释性模态公式的强制关系"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"c0c97c65cc2f7158\" href=\"?note=c0c97c65cc2f7158\" title=\"72-df-interpretability-modal-language\">72-df-interpretability-modal-language</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"5eb3411eede37b39\" href=\"?note=5eb3411eede37b39\" title=\"72-df-veltman-frame\">72-df-veltman-frame</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"VII"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.VII Definition13.4, print515/PDF527"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"source-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"statement-and-local-argument-reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"review_2026_10_22_deep","html":"新增：接口、局部推导与来源边界逐项登记"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\">\\(\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\">\\(V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak V:=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\">\\(\\mathfrak V:=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"w\\in W\">\\(w\\in W\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\">\\(A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}\\)</span>；下式沿严格子公式递归。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I p_i&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\bot_m&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow0=1,\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\to_m B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I A\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I B),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak V,v\\Vdash_I A),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\triangleright B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\land\\mathfrak V,v\\Vdash_I A\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u\\in W\\ (vS(w)u\\land\\mathfrak V,u\\Vdash_I B)),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V\\models_I A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall w\\in W\\ (\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I A).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I p_i&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\bot_m&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow0=1,\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\to_m B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I A\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I B),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak V,v\\Vdash_I A),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\triangleright B)&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\land\\mathfrak V,v\\Vdash_I A\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u\\in W\\ (vS(w)u\\land\\mathfrak V,u\\Vdash_I B)),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V\\models_I A&amp;:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall w\\in W\\ (\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I A).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>先对每个满足 A 的 R 后继，要求找到一个可能随它变化的 S(w) 后继满足 B。不能把 ∀v∃u 交换成一个公共 u，也不能把 S(w) 与 R 混为同一关系。每次递归只读取 A 或 B，故定义唯一。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-interpretability-modal-language","status":"resolved","id":"c0c97c65cc2f7158","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-veltman-frame","status":"resolved","id":"5eb3411eede37b39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-veltman-frame]]","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\operatorname{VF}(W,R,S)","display":false},{"tex":"V:\\omega\\to\\mathcal P(W)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak V:=\\langle W,R,S,V\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"w\\in W","display":false},{"tex":"A,B\\in\\mathcal F_{\\triangleright}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I p_i&:\\Longleftrightarrow w\\in V(i),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\bot_m&:\\Longleftrightarrow0=1,\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\to_m B)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n(\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I A\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I B),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I\\Box_m A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\Rightarrow\\mathfrak V,v\\Vdash_I A),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I(A\\triangleright B)&:\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\forall v\\in W\\ (R(w,v)\\land\\mathfrak V,v\\Vdash_I A\\Rightarrow\n\\exists u\\in W\\ (vS(w)u\\land\\mathfrak V,u\\Vdash_I B)),\\\\\n\\mathfrak V\\models_I A&:\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall w\\in W\\ (\\mathfrak V,w\\Vdash_I A).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1855,"backlinks":[{"id":"e6c99e2646691c7d","anchor":"ref-65","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"00439897fba390aa","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"70ff58eeae2491db","anchor":"ref-59","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expansion]] · [[72-df-veltman-forcing]] · [[72-df-veltman-frame]] · [[72-ex-veltman-non-montagna-frame]] · [[72-lem-interpretability-box-definition]] · [[72-thm-il-conservative-over-gl]] · [[72-thm-ilm-proper-extension]] · [[72-thm-interpretability-kripke-soundness]] · [[72-thm-montagna-frame-correspondence]]"},{"id":"6aa9c9e25ba49583","anchor":"ref-61","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"VII章新增11项：[[72-df-il-ilm-calculi]] · [[72-df-interpretability-modal-language]] · [[72-df-minimal-veltman-expa